int O, as shown in the figure. The combination is used as a sonometer wire and kept under tension T. The point O is midway between the two bridges. When a stationary wave is set up in the composite wire, the joint is found to be a node. The ratio of the number of antinodes formed in W<sub>1</sub>  to W<sub>2</sub>\n is :\n<br><br><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l83nzr9f/2aa489a4-5800-4f4b-8b92-76f6d2c12b33/87497130-354b-11ed-8c5c-f3f0850e6b94/file-1l83nzr9g.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l83nzr9f/2aa489a4-5800-4f4b-8b92-76f6d2c12b33/87497130-354b-11ed-8c5c-f3f0850e6b94/file-1l83nzr9g.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2017 (Online) 8th April Morning Slot Physics - Waves Question 122 English\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l83nzr9f/2aa489a4-5800-4f4b-8b92-76f6d2c12b33/87497130-354b-11ed-8c5c-f3f0850e6b94/file-1l83nzr9g.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l83nzr9f/2aa489a4-5800-4f4b-8b92-76f6d2c12b33/87497130-354b-11ed-8c5c-f3f0850e6b94/file-1l83nzr9g.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l83nzr9f/2aa489a4-5800-4f4b-8b92-76f6d2c12b33/87497130-354b-11ed-8c5c-f3f0850e6b94/file-1l83nzr9g.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l83nzr9f/2aa489a4-5800-4f4b-8b92-76f6d2c12b33/87497130-354b-11ed-8c5c-f3f0850e6b94/file-1l83nzr9g.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l83nzr9f/2aa489a4-5800-4f4b-8b92-76f6d2c12b33/87497130-354b-11ed-8c5c-f3f0850e6b94/file-1l83nzr9g.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l83nzr9f/2aa489a4-5800-4f4b-8b92-76f6d2c12b33/87497130-354b-11ed-8c5c-f3f0850e6b94/file-1l83nzr9g.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">","options":[{"identifier":"A","